ENRON.rda
Derived from the rsafd collection by Princeton University (https://github.com/princetonuniversity/rsafd).
Original license: MIT. Included in this package under the same terms.

ELECTION.rda
Based on the dataset and study: Sanders, E., de Gier, M., & van den Bosch, A. (2016),
"Using Demographics in Predicting Election Results with Twitter". Data were
obtained via personal communication with the authors and are included here with
their permission for use within this package.
